WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.473
Welcome to Orbit. Food for thought. Our focus is much / many / a little / a few.

2
00:00:08.473 --> 00:00:15.822
Use many and a few with plural countable nouns. Use much and a little with uncountable nouns.

3
00:00:15.822 --> 00:00:18.511
There is a little water in the bottle.

4
00:00:18.511 --> 00:00:20.975
How many people are coming?

5
00:00:20.975 --> 00:00:23.604
There is not much bread left.

6
00:00:23.604 --> 00:00:33.002
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
